// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 4 Loyalist_Leader :
"P540209303" "<em t=4 d=4>Quickly, {HeroName}, we must get the subject inside of the container. We have no time to lose!"
// 6 Caption :
"P1960338137" "<x=0.5 y=0.5 d=4 t=4><scale 2.75><color White><bgcolor black>Some time later..."
// 3 Loyalist_Leader :
"P3390134674" "<em explain>"
// 2 Loyalist_Leader :
"P949944015" "<em no>"
// 2 Loyalist_Leader :
"P3394288536" "<em Hmmm>"
// 1 Loyalist_Leader :
"P3223947928" "<em talk>"
// 8 Resistance_Leader :
"P2912544773" "<em talk t=4 d=4>{HeroName}, this is incredible!<t=4 d=4>Subject Zero... Louis... he is completely cured of Fixadine!"
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P3246643810" "<t=4 d=4>He can go on to live a normal life... no more cravings... no more rage!"
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P4009388853" "<em talk t=4 d=4>I can get my nephew to members of the Resistance right away."
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P3401490069" "<em t=4 d=4>They will get him out of Praetoria so he can start his life over!"
// 0 Resistance_Leader :
"P152938492" "<em cower>"
// 1 Caption :
"P3986953289" "<t=2 x= 0.1 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>INTRUDERS DETECTED IN LAB!"
// 1 Caption :
"P1416360924" "<t=2 x= 0.9 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>INTRUDERS DETECTED IN LAB!"
// 1 Caption :
"P2322498814" "<t=2 x= 0.9 y=0.7 d=2><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>INTRUDERS DETECTED IN LAB!"
// 1 Caption :
"P527348473" "<t=4 x= 0.5 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>ALERTING ALL NEARBY PPD PATROLS."
// 1 Caption :
"P1796135710" "<t=2 x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=2><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>INTRUDERS DETECTED IN LAB!"
// 1 Caption :
"P3037441084" "<t=2 x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>INTRUDERS DETECTED IN LAB!"
// 1 Caption :
"P72670422" "<t=2 x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>INTRUDERS DETECTED IN LAB!"
// 5 Resistance_Leader :
"P63302885" "<em frustrated t=5 d=5>It's the PPD! {HeroName}, you need to help me get Louis out of Praetoria!<em explain>"
// LeftText :
"P1596687944" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Release Subject Zero</color></scale><br>Help Subject Zero escape Praetoria</span><br><br><color Paragon>Aid the Resistance</color><br>Dr. Arvin plans to release Subject Zero into the hands of the Resistance, who will help him flee the government of Praetoria. You'll need to ensure no harm comes to Arvin or Zero in that time!<br><br><scale .8><color slategray><i>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P3706174334" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Apprehend Subject Zero</color></scale><br>Arrest Subject Zero for his crimes</span><br><br><color orange>Aid the Loyalists</color><br>Subject Zero is cured, but that doesn't pardon him from his past crimes. Murder, destruction... even if he isn't a Fixadine addict, he still needs to answer for his crimes.<br><br><i><scale .8><color slategray>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</scale></i>"

